# Input

```astro
---
const title="Astro";
---
<script is:inline>console.log("ready");</script>
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><title>{title}</title></head><body></body></html>
<!doctype html>

```


# Formatted

```astro
---
const title = "Astro";
---

<script is:inline>
console.log("ready");
</script>
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<title>{title}</title>
	</head>
	<body></body>
</html>
<!doctype html>

```
